---
source: tests/sync/patch_cargo_toml.rs
expression: "apply(PKG, &patch)"
---
## Input

```toml
[package]
name = "x"
version = "0.1"
```

## Patch

```
lib_path = "src/lib.rs"
build_path = "build.rs"
crate_type = ["cdylib", "rlib"]
deps:
  - napi@3 require_features=["node"]
  - serde@1 features=["derive"]
  - wasm-bindgen@0.2 require_features=["wasm", "node"]
build_deps:
  - napi-build@2
```

## Output

```toml
[package]
name = "x"
version = "0.1"
build = "build.rs"

[lib]
path = "src/lib.rs"
crate-type = ["cdylib", "rlib"]

[dependencies]
napi = { version = "3", optional = true }
serde = { version = "1", features = ["derive"] }
wasm-bindgen = { version = "0.2", optional = true }

[build-dependencies]
napi-build = { version = "2" }

[features]
node = ["dep:napi", "dep:wasm-bindgen"]
wasm = ["dep:wasm-bindgen"]
```
